1
00:01:57,680 --> 00:02:00,641
Where exactly have people seen her before?

2
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:07,040
What are you up to?

3
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,681
What's going on in there?

4
00:02:09,439 --> 00:02:15,080
From the timeline,
this itinerary goes back to last November.

5
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:20,226
But from the micro expressions,
he still doesn't seem to remember.

6
00:02:20,226 --> 00:02:22,371
Then you're full of it.

7
00:02:22,371 --> 00:02:24,556
If he really remembered,
why would he still be sitting here?

8
00:02:24,556 --> 00:02:26,122
I like talking nonsense.

9
00:02:26,122 --> 00:02:30,027
A line of nonsense
can waste a line's worth of time.

10
00:02:30,027 --> 00:02:31,160
That's deep.

11
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:34,080
If what you're saying works,
why don't you tell Mr. Fu?

12
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:36,240
Who exactly is Ruan Si Xian?

13
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:39,240
I warned him already. But he wouldn't listen.

14
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:43,745
Fine. Let me give you another lesson
in how life works.

15
00:02:43,745 --> 00:02:47,816
This is something people never learn.
This one, though, they pick up right away.

16
00:02:47,816 --> 00:02:48,880
Right?

17
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:52,505
When he needs me, I'll fill him in.

18
00:02:52,505 --> 00:02:55,066
Bai Yang, come in.

19
00:02:57,748 --> 00:03:00,108
Mr. Fu, what can I do for you?

20
00:03:06,123 --> 00:03:11,960
I began to think
that Ruan's hostility is aimed at me, not you.

21
00:03:14,946 --> 00:03:18,146
Why do you think that?

22
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:20,448
Intuition.

23
00:03:20,448 --> 00:03:22,600
- Let me break it down for you.
- I'm all ears.

24
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:25,640
Yan An sent me Ruan Si Xian's video.

25
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:27,505
He didn't treat her badly.

26
00:03:27,505 --> 00:03:30,342
She could've gone straight to Bo'ao Air.

27
00:03:30,342 --> 00:03:31,942
But...

28
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,640
No, that can't be right.

29
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:40,360
Yan An couldn't possibly be that smart.

30
00:03:41,920 --> 00:03:46,385
So what you're saying is
there's something fishy here.

31
00:03:46,385 --> 00:03:48,025
Definitely.

32
00:03:48,918 --> 00:03:51,598
[Episode 3]
[This Is Fishy]

33
00:03:52,577 --> 00:03:55,029
This one is your internal account.

34
00:03:55,029 --> 00:03:57,255
The other login passwords are in there too.

35
00:03:57,255 --> 00:03:58,960
And this one is the process form.

36
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:02,440
Take it to Facilities to get your uniform.

37
00:04:04,045 --> 00:04:05,845
[For New Hire Use, Ruan Si Xian, Pilot]

38
00:04:05,845 --> 00:04:10,136
I still know my employee number by heart.

39
00:04:10,136 --> 00:04:14,205
Only the prefix changed from E to D.

40
00:04:14,205 --> 00:04:16,965
You're a credit to Hengshi Air.

41
00:04:25,405 --> 00:04:27,005
Thank you.

42
00:04:30,485 --> 00:04:31,765
Hello? Who is this?

43
00:04:31,765 --> 00:04:34,524
<i>Ms. Ruan, it's me, Yan An.</i>

44
00:04:34,524 --> 00:04:35,565
Mr. Yan.

45
00:04:35,565 --> 00:04:37,685
- What is it?
<i>- Nothing.</i>

46
00:04:37,685 --> 00:04:41,085
I just wanted to ask
if you've reported to Hengshi yet.

47
00:04:41,085 --> 00:04:45,212
If not, would you consider Bo'ao once more?

48
00:04:45,212 --> 00:04:46,524
Bad timing.

49
00:04:46,524 --> 00:04:48,765
I just entered my HR info.

50
00:04:48,765 --> 00:04:50,805
Mr. Yan, thanks for the offer.

51
00:04:50,805 --> 00:04:53,938
You were all set to sign with Bo'ao.

52
00:04:53,938 --> 00:04:55,805
So why did you go to Hengshi?

53
00:04:55,805 --> 00:04:56,964
That's how it is.

54
00:04:56,964 --> 00:04:59,325
<i>What kind of spell did Fu Ming Yu cast on you?</i>

55
00:04:59,325 --> 00:05:01,870
<i>Did he lure you with his looks?</i>

56
00:05:01,870 --> 00:05:03,375
Why would you say that, Mr. Yan?

57
00:05:03,375 --> 00:05:09,290
Did he not?
He loves using that face to scam people.

58
00:05:09,290 --> 00:05:12,085
<i>He has broken plenty of young hearts.</i>

59
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:14,440
Well, Mr. Fu is quite the catch.

60
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:19,080
After all, talented, graceful,

61
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:22,640
<i>imposing, gentle,</i>

62
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:27,640
dignified, handsome, and dashing...

63
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:31,120
None of that applies to him.

64
00:05:34,003 --> 00:05:36,843
<i>Ms. Ruan, why are you so brutally honest?</i>

65
00:05:36,843 --> 00:05:38,923
<i>I like being around someone with your taste.</i>

66
00:05:38,923 --> 00:05:41,003
You've got a lot of free time lately, Mr. Yan.

67
00:05:41,003 --> 00:05:45,443
<i>If you're free,
think carefully about the breakup.</i>

68
00:05:45,443 --> 00:05:49,163
After all, once it was exposed,
it caused a very bad public reaction.

69
00:05:49,163 --> 00:05:52,363
Don't go around harassing my employees.

70
00:05:52,363 --> 00:05:54,363
And don't try to poach them.

71
00:05:54,363 --> 00:05:56,563
And please follow the rules of the trade.

72
00:05:56,563 --> 00:05:59,882
I don't mind taking
over your Bali travel contract.

73
00:05:59,882 --> 00:06:02,643
<i>Haven't you taken on enough already?</i>

74
00:06:08,284 --> 00:06:11,361
Ms. Ruan, we meet again.

75
00:06:11,361 --> 00:06:13,641
Welcome to Hengshi Air.

76
00:06:26,994 --> 00:06:29,754
This should be our second meeting.

77
00:06:39,321 --> 00:06:42,241
Second time?

78
00:06:42,241 --> 00:06:46,641
Ms. Ruan, you seem to know me very well.

79
00:06:46,641 --> 00:06:50,506
You heard what I just said, Mr. Fu?

80
00:06:50,506 --> 00:06:53,186
- I was just told so.
- Who told you?

81
00:06:53,186 --> 00:06:56,908
By an anonymous friend.

82
00:06:56,908 --> 00:06:59,150
Mr. Fu, sorry to interrupt.

83
00:06:59,150 --> 00:07:01,230
The meeting's about to start.

84
00:07:02,763 --> 00:07:04,443
Mr. Fu.

85
00:07:06,209 --> 00:07:08,969
- Yes?
- Sorry about that earlier.

86
00:07:08,969 --> 00:07:12,529
I shouldn't have listened to rumors
and bad-mouthed you.

87
00:07:12,529 --> 00:07:14,609
I should've gotten to know you first.

88
00:07:14,609 --> 00:07:17,249
And then keep bad-mouthing me?

89
00:07:21,129 --> 00:07:22,852
I have something else to do. I'm leaving.

90
00:07:22,852 --> 00:07:24,494
I still need to pick up my uniform.

91
00:07:24,494 --> 00:07:29,414
Then after work, remember to check your phone.

92
00:07:38,861 --> 00:07:39,929
Here.

93
00:07:39,929 --> 00:07:42,415
- Thanks.
- No problem.

94
00:07:42,415 --> 00:07:44,455
I'll get going then.

95
00:07:48,139 --> 00:07:50,129
Ruan.

96
00:07:50,129 --> 00:07:51,689
Let me take that.

97
00:07:55,101 --> 00:07:58,194
- Thanks.
- No problem. Mr. Fu sent me.

98
00:07:58,194 --> 00:08:02,154
He said there might be a lot of uniforms,
so he sent me to help.

99
00:08:05,132 --> 00:08:07,333
Let's go. We can talk on the way.

100
00:08:08,136 --> 00:08:09,609
Mr. Fu sent you?

101
00:08:09,609 --> 00:08:12,689
Well, that's nice of him.
It makes me so uneasy.

102
00:08:12,689 --> 00:08:15,849
I'll check the contract again.
Just in case there are any hidden clauses.

103
00:08:15,849 --> 00:08:19,089
How could that be?
Hengshi could never do something like that.

104
00:08:19,089 --> 00:08:20,409
Hengshi can't.

105
00:08:20,409 --> 00:08:22,849
But with Fu Ming Yu, it's hard to say.

106
00:08:22,849 --> 00:08:27,449
For some reason,
I keep feeling there is more to this.

107
00:08:27,449 --> 00:08:32,528
Ms. Ruan, about what happened three years ago,
there must have been some misunderstanding.

108
00:08:32,528 --> 00:08:36,084
But look how good things are now.
Mr. Fu is so attentive to you.

109
00:08:36,084 --> 00:08:40,369
Attentive, yet he still doesn't even
remember who I am.

110
00:08:40,369 --> 00:08:44,409
His memory's that bad?
Don't we do medical checkups at this airline?

111
00:08:46,849 --> 00:08:48,833
The higher-ups are always forgetful.

112
00:08:48,833 --> 00:08:50,329
Mr. Fu is very busy most of the time.

113
00:08:50,329 --> 00:08:51,729
Let me remind you of something.

114
00:08:51,729 --> 00:08:55,849
Tomorrow morning,
there's a photo shoot for the new pilots.

115
00:08:55,849 --> 00:08:57,649
Corporate Publicity will notify you soon.

116
00:08:57,649 --> 00:08:59,609
So tonight, get some good rest.

117
00:08:59,609 --> 00:09:03,329
Don't stay up late. Stay in top shape.

118
00:09:05,805 --> 00:09:07,325
Let's go.

119
00:09:09,969 --> 00:09:12,638
- I just checked it. Have Li review it again.
- Okay. There shouldn't be any problems.

120
00:09:12,638 --> 00:09:15,078
- You two head back first.
- Okay.

121
00:09:21,370 --> 00:09:22,836
Boss.

122
00:09:22,836 --> 00:09:25,129
Smells pretty good.

123
00:09:25,129 --> 00:09:28,329
Bring me last year's full travel log.

124
00:09:31,796 --> 00:09:33,796
Do you want some?

125
00:09:34,868 --> 00:09:36,628
The last two years' records.

126
00:09:48,500 --> 00:09:50,125
What's going on?

127
00:09:50,125 --> 00:09:51,769
Isn't that Mr. Fu's assistant?

128
00:09:51,769 --> 00:09:54,434
Why would he be with Ruan Si Xian?

129
00:09:54,434 --> 00:09:55,689
Let's go, let's go.

130
00:09:55,689 --> 00:09:57,809
She must have a pretty strong backing.

131
00:10:02,622 --> 00:10:05,142
Bai Yang, come in.

132
00:10:10,929 --> 00:10:12,529
The more I think about it,

133
00:10:12,529 --> 00:10:15,289
the more I feel
that Ruan's hostility is aimed at me.

134
00:10:15,289 --> 00:10:18,849
Ruan's "hospitality" is for me?

135
00:10:18,849 --> 00:10:23,070
So you think there's something fishy here?

136
00:10:23,070 --> 00:10:24,455
Definitely.

137
00:10:24,455 --> 00:10:25,962
Fish?

138
00:10:25,962 --> 00:10:27,642
Fish what?

139
00:10:28,462 --> 00:10:30,089
Fish and chips?

140
00:10:30,089 --> 00:10:32,289
Mr. Fu, so that's how it is.

141
00:10:32,289 --> 00:10:38,329
I think it's time to get tougher.

142
00:10:41,881 --> 00:10:44,041
It's not that serious.

143
00:10:48,468 --> 00:10:50,009
Go to HR.

144
00:10:50,009 --> 00:10:52,329
Pull Ruan Si Xian's file.

145
00:10:52,329 --> 00:10:55,169
That's wise!

146
00:10:58,529 --> 00:10:59,728
Come on, Qiao Qiao. Hurry.

147
00:10:59,728 --> 00:11:01,248
Go to HR and pull Ruan Si Xian's file.

148
00:11:01,248 --> 00:11:02,768
Hurry.

149
00:11:02,768 --> 00:11:05,689
Why are you so worked up over a file?

150
00:11:16,329 --> 00:11:20,170
I told you not to steal my project.

151
00:11:23,369 --> 00:11:27,810
And stop acting and pretending.

152
00:11:31,266 --> 00:11:34,427
Stop stealing.

153
00:11:35,472 --> 00:11:37,209
Are you okay, Fu Ming Yu?

154
00:11:37,209 --> 00:11:39,369
Can you shut up and focus?

155
00:11:39,369 --> 00:11:41,169
No.

156
00:11:41,969 --> 00:11:47,234
If I don't roast your workout,
does it even count as exercise?

157
00:11:47,234 --> 00:11:49,154
Right?

158
00:11:50,449 --> 00:11:56,409
Ruan was going to fall for me
after joining Bo'ao.

159
00:11:56,409 --> 00:11:59,009
I even picked a kindergarten for our kid.

160
00:11:59,009 --> 00:12:03,329
But you beat me to her.

161
00:12:05,404 --> 00:12:08,309
Still, Mr. Fu, I have to thank you.

162
00:12:08,309 --> 00:12:12,889
Now there's no work tying me to her.

163
00:12:12,889 --> 00:12:17,129
We can date even more openly.

164
00:12:22,889 --> 00:12:26,049
I need to speed things up for us.

165
00:12:26,049 --> 00:12:29,129
Ruan Si Xian.

166
00:12:30,889 --> 00:12:34,085
Ms. Ruan. Are you free lately?

167
00:12:34,085 --> 00:12:36,169
Want to grab afternoon tea?

168
00:12:36,169 --> 00:12:38,689
What's with the vocal fry? That's sleazy.

169
00:12:38,689 --> 00:12:41,449
That's what a sexy man's voice sounds like.

170
00:12:42,309 --> 00:12:43,429
You're her WeChat friend?

171
00:12:43,429 --> 00:12:44,989
Yeah.

172
00:12:44,989 --> 00:12:46,549
Ruan...

173
00:12:50,877 --> 00:12:56,722
Don't tell me
someone hasn't added her on WeChat.

174
00:12:56,722 --> 00:12:58,416
I feel better now.

175
00:12:58,416 --> 00:13:00,440
[Ruan Si Xian]
[This is Fu Ming Yu]

176
00:13:04,642 --> 00:13:07,442
<i>I've just started, so I'm a bit busy.</i>

177
00:13:10,802 --> 00:13:12,587
Ms. Ruan, I'm waiting for you.

178
00:13:12,587 --> 00:13:15,152
I have all the time in the world.

179
00:13:15,152 --> 00:13:17,594
Mr. Fu, you're done?

180
00:13:17,594 --> 00:13:19,514
Leaving already?

181
00:13:20,990 --> 00:13:22,630
<i>Ms. Ruan, I'm waiting for you.</i>

182
00:13:22,630 --> 00:13:24,990
<i>I have all the time in the world.</i>

183
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:33,263
[Fu Ming Yu, Add Friend]
[Delete]

184
00:13:37,150 --> 00:13:40,990
<i>Why isn't there a reject button
for friend requests?</i>

185
00:13:40,990 --> 00:13:45,790
<i>What a shame I can't directly reject him.</i>

186
00:13:45,790 --> 00:13:48,870
<i>If they had a button
for never accepting this person's request,</i>

187
00:13:48,870 --> 00:13:50,830
<i>it would be even better.</i>

188
00:13:57,123 --> 00:13:59,550
<i>Maybe it's to protect the other person's pride.</i>

189
00:13:59,550 --> 00:14:02,710
<i>Just ignore people like that.</i>

190
00:14:04,476 --> 00:14:06,030
<i>You're right.</i>

191
00:14:06,030 --> 00:14:08,950
<i>Looks like you're wiser than I am.</i>

192
00:14:28,819 --> 00:14:30,979
Anything else you need?

193
00:14:32,350 --> 00:14:33,630
What are you laughing at?

194
00:14:33,630 --> 00:14:37,550
Nothing. Just looking at Ms. Ruan's Moments.

195
00:14:37,550 --> 00:14:39,910
It's funny and pretty insightful.

196
00:14:39,910 --> 00:14:41,550
What did she say?

197
00:14:41,550 --> 00:14:43,430
See for yourself.

198
00:14:46,750 --> 00:14:48,430
Well...

199
00:14:50,203 --> 00:14:52,030
<i>Why isn't there a reject button
for friend requests?</i>

200
00:14:52,030 --> 00:14:54,829
<i>What a shame I can't directly reject him.</i>

201
00:14:54,829 --> 00:14:56,750
<i>If they had a button
for never accepting this person's request,</i>

202
00:14:56,750 --> 00:14:57,751
<i>it would be even better.</i>

203
00:14:57,751 --> 00:15:00,470
- Funny?
- That's not funny at all.

204
00:15:02,150 --> 00:15:05,390
Did you tell her about tomorrow's promo shoot?

205
00:15:05,390 --> 00:15:08,350
Zeng Yu already briefed Ruan Si Xian
on the campaign plan in detail.

206
00:15:08,350 --> 00:15:11,270
Not "briefed". It's a discussion.

207
00:15:11,270 --> 00:15:14,830
Tell Zeng Yu to fully respect Ruan's opinion.

208
00:15:14,830 --> 00:15:16,430
Got it.

209
00:15:22,523 --> 00:15:24,003
Hello?

210
00:15:25,669 --> 00:15:27,790
I know you've landed.

211
00:15:27,790 --> 00:15:30,070
The hotel is already arranged.

212
00:15:30,870 --> 00:15:33,750
Why would I stay at a hotel? I have a home.

213
00:15:33,750 --> 00:15:35,230
What's your problem?

214
00:15:35,230 --> 00:15:37,030
I came all this way to help you.

215
00:15:37,030 --> 00:15:38,950
And you send a driver to pick me up?

216
00:15:38,950 --> 00:15:41,510
Just wait till I fleece you tomorrow.

217
00:15:42,701 --> 00:15:45,589
Didn't you win the bid because
you were the best value?

218
00:15:45,589 --> 00:15:50,204
If you fleece me,
then I need to think this over.

219
00:15:50,204 --> 00:15:54,305
Fine. Today, I'll let you play client
for a change.

220
00:15:54,305 --> 00:15:56,625
Just you wait.

221
00:16:07,964 --> 00:16:10,084
Back this late?

222
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:15,000
You aren't early either.

223
00:16:29,564 --> 00:16:31,804
Have you been drinking?

224
00:16:33,384 --> 00:16:35,020
You've been drinking, haven't you?

225
00:16:35,020 --> 00:16:36,622
You just came up and sniffed me.

226
00:16:36,622 --> 00:16:39,782
Anyone sober wouldn't do that.

227
00:16:41,004 --> 00:16:43,465
I didn't mean anything by it.

228
00:16:43,465 --> 00:16:45,038
You have a shoot tomorrow.

229
00:16:45,038 --> 00:16:46,520
I just wanted to remind you.

230
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:50,011
Drinking can cause swelling.

231
00:16:50,011 --> 00:16:52,251
I said I didn't drink.

232
00:17:14,137 --> 00:17:17,537
How long are you planning
to keep your eyes closed like that?

233
00:17:30,246 --> 00:17:32,886
Didn't I already say that?

234
00:17:54,524 --> 00:17:57,604
<i>How long are you planning
to keep your eyes closed like that?</i>

235
00:17:58,804 --> 00:18:02,444
<i>How much longer are you planning to sit here?</i>

236
00:18:05,844 --> 00:18:07,644
Can't be.

237
00:18:10,936 --> 00:18:14,056
<i>Mr. Fu, long time no see.</i>

238
00:18:17,644 --> 00:18:19,484
It's her.

239
00:18:50,290 --> 00:18:52,132
That's disgusting.

240
00:18:52,132 --> 00:18:54,533
Why would I dream that?

241
00:18:55,604 --> 00:18:57,684
Most people bully others by leaning on power.

242
00:18:57,684 --> 00:18:59,964
He just bullies, with or without power!

243
00:19:28,084 --> 00:19:29,804
Mr. Fu.

244
00:19:29,804 --> 00:19:31,677
Morning.

245
00:19:31,677 --> 00:19:33,277
Morning.

246
00:20:16,484 --> 00:20:18,789
What are you doing? Stealing my earbuds?

247
00:20:18,789 --> 00:20:20,004
No.

248
00:20:20,004 --> 00:20:22,284
I think we should talk.

249
00:20:22,851 --> 00:20:25,076
I keep feeling like you have a problem with me.

250
00:20:25,076 --> 00:20:26,371
Yes.

251
00:20:26,371 --> 00:20:28,091
I hate anyone named Fu.

252
00:20:40,731 --> 00:20:42,331
Morning, Mr. Fu.

253
00:21:01,011 --> 00:21:02,651
Stop that.

254
00:21:05,348 --> 00:21:07,171
Sorry. It scared you.

255
00:21:07,171 --> 00:21:08,491
It's okay.

256
00:21:08,491 --> 00:21:10,651
Liuliu doesn't bite anyway.

257
00:21:20,304 --> 00:21:22,144
Are you scared of dogs?

258
00:21:23,741 --> 00:21:25,741
I was bitten as a kid.

259
00:21:32,623 --> 00:21:34,030
Mr. Fu.

260
00:21:41,139 --> 00:21:44,051
Here. Wipe it off.

261
00:21:51,691 --> 00:21:54,371
There's more in back.

262
00:21:56,250 --> 00:21:58,050
I'll do it.

263
00:22:25,571 --> 00:22:26,890
That's enough.

264
00:22:26,890 --> 00:22:29,131
- Done.
- Thanks.

265
00:22:31,571 --> 00:22:33,771
I'll give you a ride.

266
00:22:33,771 --> 00:22:37,051
Okay. Thanks.

267
00:22:57,509 --> 00:22:58,906
By the way, Mr. Fu.

268
00:22:58,906 --> 00:23:03,117
Mr. Qin had someone deliver an invitation
to your office yesterday afternoon.

269
00:23:03,117 --> 00:23:05,626
His wedding is on the seventh next month.
Will you be going?

270
00:23:05,626 --> 00:23:07,251
Which Mr. Qin?

271
00:23:07,251 --> 00:23:11,291
The son of the chairman of Zhengxi Steel,
Qin Jia Hang.

272
00:23:11,291 --> 00:23:15,331
He's marrying the flight attendant
at our company. Remember her?

273
00:23:15,331 --> 00:23:20,091
The girl who accidentally spilled coffee all
over him in first class.

274
00:23:24,091 --> 00:23:26,251
That was quite a stunt.

275
00:23:31,691 --> 00:23:35,276
<i>You don't want to be our flight attendant?</i>

276
00:23:35,276 --> 00:23:37,221
<i>I don't want to be a Hengshi flight attendant.</i>

277
00:23:37,221 --> 00:23:39,851
<i>- I want to be--
- The boss's wife.</i>

278
00:23:39,851 --> 00:23:42,171
<i>Keep dreaming.</i>

279
00:23:47,569 --> 00:23:52,891
I heard Mr. Qin doesn't seem very happy
with this marriage.

280
00:23:52,891 --> 00:23:54,371
He said it went ahead without his consent.

281
00:23:54,371 --> 00:23:56,491
I was wondering if maybe you could...

282
00:23:56,491 --> 00:23:58,931
I won't go. Please turn them down for me.

283
00:23:58,931 --> 00:24:00,971
Okay, got it.

284
00:24:17,371 --> 00:24:21,131
It's... It's a little warm.

285
00:24:22,011 --> 00:24:24,971
Ms. Ruan, want some water?

286
00:24:25,765 --> 00:24:27,051
I'll open it for you.

287
00:24:27,051 --> 00:24:28,211
Let me.

288
00:24:28,211 --> 00:24:29,651
Let me.

289
00:24:31,491 --> 00:24:33,251
You're good.

290
00:24:35,731 --> 00:24:38,931
No wonder you're the kind of woman
who can send people flying.

291
00:24:39,651 --> 00:24:42,411
I can send people to the grave.

292
00:25:22,229 --> 00:25:23,691
What is it?

293
00:25:23,691 --> 00:25:26,811
Now that you've taken a few shots at me,
are you feeling better now?

294
00:25:26,811 --> 00:25:28,171
Sorry, Mr. Fu.

295
00:25:28,171 --> 00:25:30,451
I just speak my mind.

296
00:25:30,451 --> 00:25:31,771
No offense intended.

297
00:25:31,771 --> 00:25:33,411
You won't take it personally, will you?

298
00:25:33,411 --> 00:25:35,211
Of course not.

299
00:25:35,211 --> 00:25:37,651
But you didn't have to show it on your face.

300
00:25:52,751 --> 00:25:55,233
Please pull over up ahead. I'll get out there.

301
00:25:55,233 --> 00:25:58,875
- Ms. Ruan, we're not there yet.
- I know. I'll get out up ahead.

302
00:25:58,875 --> 00:26:01,371
The front gate is crowded.
Let's avoid any gossip.

303
00:26:01,371 --> 00:26:03,091
Is that really necessary?

304
00:26:04,374 --> 00:26:05,783
What do you mean?

305
00:26:05,783 --> 00:26:09,211
We're not in a relationship
that calls for that, are we?

306
00:26:43,891 --> 00:26:45,811
He's avoiding me that fast.

307
00:26:45,811 --> 00:26:47,531
Did he borrow those legs
and rush to return them?

308
00:26:47,531 --> 00:26:49,851
Ms. Ruan, we're starting soon.

309
00:26:49,851 --> 00:26:51,851
I'll take you over there first.

310
00:26:56,811 --> 00:26:58,452
Come in.

311
00:27:00,531 --> 00:27:02,997
Mr. Fu, here's Ruan Si Xian's file.

312
00:27:02,997 --> 00:27:04,597
Wait.

313
00:27:07,051 --> 00:27:09,091
Have you read the file?

314
00:27:09,091 --> 00:27:10,971
No, I haven't.

315
00:27:10,971 --> 00:27:12,571
Do you think Bai Yang knows about this?

316
00:27:12,571 --> 00:27:14,331
He's always known.

317
00:27:14,331 --> 00:27:17,718
- Didn't you say you hadn't read it?
- I haven't, but I don't need to.

318
00:27:17,718 --> 00:27:19,758
I've always known too.

319
00:27:20,891 --> 00:27:23,811
Mr. Fu, if that's all, I'll get going.

320
00:27:36,331 --> 00:27:39,771
[New Employee Registration Form]

321
00:27:43,691 --> 00:27:48,091
[Hengshi Jiang City HQ, Crew Division Four]

322
00:27:57,583 --> 00:27:59,288
Aren't we taking pictures?

323
00:27:59,288 --> 00:28:01,513
Why did you bring me to the warehouse?

324
00:28:01,513 --> 00:28:03,498
This was our photographer's idea.

325
00:28:03,498 --> 00:28:07,807
This warehouse is huge,
so we have the space to shoot properly.

326
00:28:07,807 --> 00:28:10,492
Ruan, thanks for coming.
We dragged you here so early.

327
00:28:10,492 --> 00:28:12,294
Ruan, let me properly introduce you.

328
00:28:12,294 --> 00:28:15,056
This is Zeng Yu,
our Corporate Publicity manager.

329
00:28:15,056 --> 00:28:17,132
- Nice to meet you.
- Hello.

330
00:28:17,132 --> 00:28:20,335
- No need to introduce her.
- No introduction needed. She's gorgeous.

331
00:28:20,335 --> 00:28:22,143
Let's get started.

332
00:28:22,143 --> 00:28:24,022
- Let's go.
- This way.

333
00:28:24,022 --> 00:28:25,624
Then let's start with makeup.

334
00:28:25,624 --> 00:28:27,666
Honestly, makeup is optional.

335
00:28:27,666 --> 00:28:28,837
You're naturally beautiful.

336
00:28:28,837 --> 00:28:31,196
You look like a celebrity.

337
00:28:31,196 --> 00:28:32,836
Over here.

338
00:28:33,903 --> 00:28:35,783
Make it look good.

339
00:28:38,988 --> 00:28:41,277
Go on, Mr. Zeng.

340
00:28:41,277 --> 00:28:46,437
Okay, Ruan. While they work on you,
I'll quickly walk you through the plan.

341
00:28:46,437 --> 00:28:51,517
Mr. Fu designed this plan
for the new aircraft model.

342
00:28:51,517 --> 00:28:53,357
It goes fully live on the maiden flight.

343
00:28:53,357 --> 00:28:55,477
Once this plan rolls out,

344
00:28:55,477 --> 00:28:58,317
it'll blow the old Hengshi Air campaign
out of the water.

345
00:28:58,317 --> 00:28:59,997
It'll be absolutely unprecedented.

346
00:28:59,997 --> 00:29:02,717
- Truly one of a kind--
- Wait.

347
00:29:03,756 --> 00:29:05,615
Just me?

348
00:29:05,615 --> 00:29:07,242
What about the other pilots?

349
00:29:07,242 --> 00:29:09,882
I'm just a follow-up pilot.

350
00:29:11,430 --> 00:29:13,117
Here's the thing, Ruan.

351
00:29:13,117 --> 00:29:16,662
Everyone's schedules are completely staggered.

352
00:29:16,662 --> 00:29:20,917
- You're the first one we're shooting.
- Yes. And you're the most important one.

353
00:29:20,917 --> 00:29:24,292
You'll become the face
of Hengshi's new aircraft campaign.

354
00:29:24,292 --> 00:29:28,197
This is a real honor.

355
00:29:29,677 --> 00:29:31,117
So...

356
00:29:31,117 --> 00:29:37,117
The real reason Mr. Fu insisted
on signing me for this?

357
00:29:44,563 --> 00:29:48,723
I'm sorry, but may I ask
if Mr. Fu is coming today?

358
00:29:48,723 --> 00:29:50,447
He...

359
00:29:50,447 --> 00:29:51,763
Well...

360
00:29:51,763 --> 00:29:53,963
Barring any surprises,
he should be here any minute.

361
00:29:53,963 --> 00:29:56,963
Then may I ask to speak with him?

362
00:29:58,123 --> 00:29:59,363
Don't worry.

363
00:29:59,363 --> 00:30:02,323
I'll step outside, make a call,
and ask him for you, okay?

364
00:30:02,323 --> 00:30:04,363
You get your makeup done first.

365
00:30:04,363 --> 00:30:06,043
Mr. Zeng.

366
00:30:06,043 --> 00:30:08,523
I'm not trying to make your job harder.

367
00:30:08,523 --> 00:30:12,963
I just want to understand a few things first.

368
00:30:12,963 --> 00:30:14,683
I understand.

369
00:30:15,483 --> 00:30:17,163
I totally do.

370
00:30:18,750 --> 00:30:22,663
- Why are you in such a panic?
- It's Ruan Si Xian. She...

371
00:30:22,663 --> 00:30:24,223
She...

372
00:30:25,103 --> 00:30:27,203
I was just looking for her.

373
00:30:27,203 --> 00:30:28,803
Perfect.

374
00:30:35,930 --> 00:30:37,395
Mr. Fu.

375
00:30:37,395 --> 00:30:39,300
I really don't like this feeling.

376
00:30:39,300 --> 00:30:40,650
And now I have to vent to you again.

377
00:30:40,650 --> 00:30:43,170
Is there something wrong with the shoot?

378
00:30:43,170 --> 00:30:45,210
You called me back--

379
00:30:48,650 --> 00:30:52,850
You called me back just for publicity?

380
00:30:52,850 --> 00:30:56,715
Even if it was,
it still shouldn't have centered on me.

381
00:30:56,715 --> 00:31:00,835
Captain Fan Lei and Captain Yue Yang,
they're both a better fit than I am.

382
00:31:08,848 --> 00:31:11,257
What's wrong? You don't feel well?

383
00:31:11,257 --> 00:31:13,179
That doesn't matter.

384
00:31:13,179 --> 00:31:16,261
I just wanted to check
if we can change the shoot plan.

385
00:31:16,261 --> 00:31:19,102
I asked if you weren't feeling well.

386
00:31:20,423 --> 00:31:22,345
I was fine just now.

387
00:31:22,345 --> 00:31:25,130
Bai Yang, take Ruan Si Xian
back to the apartment to rest.

388
00:31:25,130 --> 00:31:28,238
Let's stop filming for today.

389
00:31:28,238 --> 00:31:30,763
Don't give me that.
Use my car to take her back to rest.

390
00:31:30,763 --> 00:31:32,810
Whether I rest or not isn't the point.

391
00:31:32,810 --> 00:31:36,490
What matters is
that you listen carefully to me.

392
00:31:53,821 --> 00:31:57,141
I won't make the same mistake twice.

393
00:32:00,157 --> 00:32:03,957
The same mistake?

394
00:32:04,570 --> 00:32:07,090
I'm listening carefully.

395
00:32:08,010 --> 00:32:09,995
Go back and get some rest.

396
00:32:09,995 --> 00:32:12,915
I'll adjust the shoot plan later.

397
00:32:17,041 --> 00:32:18,364
Go on.

398
00:32:18,364 --> 00:32:19,924
Bai Yang.

399
00:32:20,609 --> 00:32:22,370
Ms. Ruan.

400
00:32:22,370 --> 00:32:24,690
I'll drive you back.

401
00:32:28,603 --> 00:32:30,043
Let's go.

402
00:32:43,390 --> 00:32:46,232
I really can't understand that.

403
00:32:46,232 --> 00:32:48,674
He goes after you. Why take it out on me?

404
00:32:48,674 --> 00:32:51,526
How am I torturing you? You said it yourself.

405
00:32:51,526 --> 00:32:53,804
Whenever I'm unhappy,
you always take me out to have fun.

406
00:32:53,804 --> 00:32:56,503
Then let's have fun.
Something laid-back and artsy, okay?

407
00:32:56,503 --> 00:32:57,865
How about golf?

408
00:32:57,865 --> 00:33:00,587
I've never done something this bold before.

409
00:33:00,587 --> 00:33:03,709
Do you know
that this is also called "ballet on the wall"?

410
00:33:03,709 --> 00:33:04,831
How artsy!

411
00:33:04,831 --> 00:33:06,567
Just climb.

412
00:33:06,567 --> 00:33:08,529
Go.

413
00:33:08,529 --> 00:33:10,050
Keep me safe.

414
00:33:10,050 --> 00:33:13,118
I haven't done anything to any of you.

415
00:33:13,118 --> 00:33:16,839
I haven't done anything to anyone either.
So why do I deserve to be stood up?

416
00:33:16,839 --> 00:33:18,762
Enough. What are you still looking at?

417
00:33:18,762 --> 00:33:20,610
Grab some chalk and get on the wall.

418
00:33:20,610 --> 00:33:22,186
You wanted this.

419
00:33:22,186 --> 00:33:26,268
All Mr. Fu had to do was flick his fingers,
and you went running over to him.

420
00:33:26,268 --> 00:33:27,710
You've been like this since you were little.

421
00:33:27,710 --> 00:33:28,835
You can't shake it.

422
00:33:28,835 --> 00:33:31,117
I came back this time purely for the money.

423
00:33:31,117 --> 00:33:34,034
You expect me to believe that?
You, Zheng You An, need the money?

424
00:33:34,034 --> 00:33:35,476
If you really had that kind of backbone,

425
00:33:35,476 --> 00:33:37,662
would you really fly back
if I bought you a ticket now?

426
00:33:37,662 --> 00:33:39,504
Wasn't the route I picked for you hard enough?

427
00:33:39,504 --> 00:33:41,746
How are you still making snide remarks
when you're on the wall?

428
00:33:41,746 --> 00:33:43,228
Save your ticket!
I just don't want to waste money.

429
00:33:43,228 --> 00:33:44,710
And that has nothing to do with him!

430
00:33:44,710 --> 00:33:47,672
Besides, I've long since lost
whatever feelings I had for him.

431
00:33:47,672 --> 00:33:50,634
The sweet, childish memory I had of him
has almost faded.

432
00:33:50,634 --> 00:33:56,235
I never believe in pure male-female friendship.

433
00:33:56,235 --> 00:33:58,632
Aren't we just that?

434
00:33:59,503 --> 00:34:01,499
- Let go.
- I can't. I can't let go.

435
00:34:01,499 --> 00:34:05,343
Your feet are almost on the ground.
Let go. It's fine.

436
00:34:07,410 --> 00:34:08,628
Cut it out.

437
00:34:08,628 --> 00:34:11,909
Fu Ming Yu.

438
00:34:13,428 --> 00:34:15,030
Liar.

439
00:34:15,810 --> 00:34:17,170
Easy.

440
00:34:17,170 --> 00:34:19,210
You'll burst my drum if you keep that up.

441
00:34:19,210 --> 00:34:23,530
Looks like the painkillers are kicking in.
You're fine now.

442
00:34:23,530 --> 00:34:26,635
Thanks for the painkillers
and the sanitary pads.

443
00:34:26,635 --> 00:34:31,300
But then again,
isn't Fu Ming Yu just a straight-up scammer?

444
00:34:31,300 --> 00:34:33,810
I thought I'd downloaded an anti-scam app.

445
00:34:33,810 --> 00:34:36,100
And it still didn't stop him.

446
00:34:36,100 --> 00:34:38,446
A scam has to get something out of you.

447
00:34:38,446 --> 00:34:40,791
What did he scam out of you?

448
00:34:40,791 --> 00:34:42,016
Your money?

449
00:34:42,016 --> 00:34:45,991
I remember he gave you double relocation pay.

450
00:34:45,991 --> 00:34:49,672
Or maybe he scammed your feelings?

451
00:34:49,672 --> 00:34:51,779
He ruined my dream!

452
00:34:51,779 --> 00:34:55,356
He tempted me with double pay
and a homegrown jet.

453
00:34:55,356 --> 00:34:57,915
Who could resist that kind of temptation?

454
00:34:57,915 --> 00:34:59,580
He's a top-tier con artist.

455
00:34:59,580 --> 00:35:02,805
He knows exactly what we need
and hits us right where it hurts.

456
00:35:02,805 --> 00:35:05,150
Honestly, I think it's fine.

457
00:35:05,150 --> 00:35:11,410
You've got to represent Hengshi
and promote a homegrown jet.

458
00:35:11,410 --> 00:35:13,071
I envy you.

459
00:35:13,071 --> 00:35:14,858
If I could go,

460
00:35:14,858 --> 00:35:20,285
I'd eat balanced meals for life
and pray for my career to take off.

461
00:35:20,285 --> 00:35:23,250
I'll switch with you. You take the promotion.

462
00:35:23,890 --> 00:35:24,703
Seriously.

463
00:35:24,703 --> 00:35:28,183
Promoting Z101 was no problem.

464
00:35:28,183 --> 00:35:32,250
I wasn't surprised
by how he squeezed extra value out of workers.

465
00:35:32,250 --> 00:35:35,538
But he can't use my dream to lure me in

466
00:35:35,538 --> 00:35:38,770
and then tell me I was just a gimmick.

467
00:35:38,770 --> 00:35:40,205
That's twisted.

468
00:35:40,205 --> 00:35:45,872
Since the result's the same,
do you really care how he put it?

469
00:35:45,872 --> 00:35:47,898
Of course I do.

470
00:35:47,898 --> 00:35:50,300
He's insulting my dream.

471
00:35:50,300 --> 00:35:52,330
Besides,

472
00:35:52,330 --> 00:35:57,555
a rookie like me doesn't get
to promote a homegrown jet.

473
00:35:57,555 --> 00:35:59,060
You can stop dreaming.

474
00:35:59,060 --> 00:36:01,602
Reality's about to slap you in the face.

475
00:36:01,602 --> 00:36:03,928
There's a guest. I'll head down first.

476
00:36:03,928 --> 00:36:05,935
Then take a break for a bit.

477
00:36:05,935 --> 00:36:08,935
I'll go do grunt work for Xuan.

478
00:36:21,050 --> 00:36:24,916
So you already knew who she was?

479
00:36:24,916 --> 00:36:26,490
Yes.

480
00:36:26,490 --> 00:36:32,170
Three years ago, when we went to Ma'ao,
she was on that flight.

481
00:36:33,370 --> 00:36:37,715
She even served you a few cups of coffee.

482
00:36:37,715 --> 00:36:42,650
Do you remember now?

483
00:36:42,650 --> 00:36:44,610
<i>I don't want to be a Hengshi flight attendant.</i>

484
00:36:44,610 --> 00:36:47,210
<i>- I want to be--
- The boss's wife.</i>

485
00:36:47,210 --> 00:36:48,652
<i>Keep dreaming.</i>

486
00:36:48,652 --> 00:36:50,850
<i>Don't forget you're still
wearing the Hengshi Air uniform.</i>

487
00:36:50,850 --> 00:36:53,490
<i>Can you at least consider the company's image?</i>

488
00:36:53,490 --> 00:36:56,405
<i>Mr. Fu, please read this letter.</i>

489
00:36:56,405 --> 00:36:59,770
<i>Once you read it, you'll understand everything.</i>

490
00:37:01,010 --> 00:37:03,795
Later, she showed up at Alvin's party too.

491
00:37:03,795 --> 00:37:08,660
Didn't you talk to her for a while?

492
00:37:08,660 --> 00:37:12,285
<i>Would you believe me
if I said today was pure coincidence?</i>

493
00:37:12,285 --> 00:37:15,567
<i>Yes. Of course I do.
I'd even believe you could fly.</i>

494
00:37:15,567 --> 00:37:18,688
<i>I think you just want a shortcut.</i>

495
00:37:20,370 --> 00:37:24,850
She quit after the party ended.

496
00:37:25,450 --> 00:37:28,858
Mr. Fu, I actually warned you.

497
00:37:28,858 --> 00:37:30,965
When I was sorting through your work email,

498
00:37:30,965 --> 00:37:35,810
I found she sent you a dozen emails
about the Soar Initiative.

499
00:37:35,810 --> 00:37:38,130
By then, she'd already passed
the Soar Initiative screening.

500
00:37:38,130 --> 00:37:41,291
She had already been admitted
to Flight Academy.

501
00:37:42,883 --> 00:37:47,710
Later, at Flight Academy, I met her
and remembered what happened.

502
00:37:47,710 --> 00:37:51,817
Back then, it wasn't just you.

503
00:37:51,817 --> 00:37:55,620
Maybe we all had Ruan Si Xian wrong.

504
00:38:02,530 --> 00:38:05,610
She even got into the Soar Initiative.

505
00:38:05,610 --> 00:38:08,330
- Yes.
- She just wants to be a pilot.

506
00:38:08,330 --> 00:38:11,530
She had no other agenda at all.
She just wants to be a pilot.

507
00:38:11,530 --> 00:38:15,170
Then if you knew she wanted to be a pilot,

508
00:38:16,690 --> 00:38:19,515
why didn't you warn me sooner?

509
00:38:19,515 --> 00:38:22,635
Back at the Aviation Academy,

510
00:38:23,890 --> 00:38:27,075
Ruan Si Xian threatened me.

511
00:38:27,075 --> 00:38:31,780
<i>If Mr. Fu never figures out who I am,
I'd appreciate it if you don't fill him in.</i>

512
00:38:31,780 --> 00:38:34,700
<i>Because I want nothing to do with him.</i>

513
00:38:37,650 --> 00:38:40,035
I can't believe she cares that much
about what happened three years ago.

514
00:38:40,035 --> 00:38:41,091
It's the exact opposite.

515
00:38:41,091 --> 00:38:43,595
Mr. Fu, it's the exact opposite.

516
00:38:43,595 --> 00:38:48,757
She doesn't want you to feel indebted
because you misjudged her.

517
00:38:48,757 --> 00:38:50,224
That's why she never brought it up.

518
00:38:50,224 --> 00:38:53,561
She came to Hengshi
for that Chinese-built jumbo jet.

519
00:38:53,561 --> 00:38:57,069
She wanted to earn it
through her own hard work and skill.

520
00:38:57,069 --> 00:39:01,389
As for everything else,
she moved on a long time ago.

521
00:39:02,276 --> 00:39:03,876
Bai Yang.

522
00:39:06,278 --> 00:39:09,558
Every time she sees me, she bites my head off.

523
00:39:10,416 --> 00:39:14,416
Do you really think she's moved on?

524
00:39:20,404 --> 00:39:23,199
I really think you've been off for two days.

525
00:39:23,199 --> 00:39:25,426
Have I? I don't think so.

526
00:39:25,426 --> 00:39:27,466
You're overthinking it.

527
00:39:28,570 --> 00:39:30,303
Is this the place?

528
00:39:30,303 --> 00:39:33,610
This is the bar they recommended.

529
00:39:33,610 --> 00:39:36,130
It's pretty lively.

530
00:39:39,010 --> 00:39:41,610
Good evening. Welcome aboard.

531
00:39:41,610 --> 00:39:43,485
Sit anywhere you like.

532
00:39:43,485 --> 00:39:44,970
Okay...

533
00:39:44,970 --> 00:39:47,481
How about over here?
It's quieter and less crowded.

534
00:39:47,481 --> 00:39:49,587
Okay. Right there.

535
00:39:49,587 --> 00:39:51,793
Thanks.

536
00:39:51,793 --> 00:39:53,555
Careful.

537
00:39:53,555 --> 00:39:54,837
Then let's sit here.

538
00:39:54,837 --> 00:39:56,317
Okay.

539
00:39:59,037 --> 00:40:00,758
Please have a seat.

540
00:40:04,850 --> 00:40:08,209
Here is our drink menu.
Take a look and see what you'd like.

541
00:40:08,209 --> 00:40:09,918
You're the owner?

542
00:40:09,918 --> 00:40:10,920
Yes.

543
00:40:10,920 --> 00:40:14,050
Then we don't need to look.
I'll go with your choice.

544
00:40:14,050 --> 00:40:15,728
I'll have what he's having.

545
00:40:15,728 --> 00:40:16,743
Okay.

546
00:40:16,743 --> 00:40:20,024
We have a refreshing jasmine cocktail.

547
00:40:20,024 --> 00:40:21,203
It's called Pilot's Halo.

548
00:40:21,203 --> 00:40:23,369
Perfect for this lovely lady.

549
00:40:23,369 --> 00:40:24,851
What would suit me?

550
00:40:24,851 --> 00:40:27,210
For you, I'd recommend Captain Sully.

551
00:40:27,210 --> 00:40:28,992
It's a whiskey-based cocktail.

552
00:40:28,992 --> 00:40:30,234
Does that work for you two?

553
00:40:30,234 --> 00:40:31,338
Sure. Your call.

554
00:40:31,338 --> 00:40:33,730
Great. Please give me a moment.

555
00:40:39,661 --> 00:40:44,130
You said this place is a flight-themed bar.

556
00:40:44,130 --> 00:40:46,610
No wonder. I heard her say "Welcome aboard,"

557
00:40:46,610 --> 00:40:48,305
and thought it was you.

558
00:40:48,305 --> 00:40:51,170
You seemed pretty happy to hear it.

559
00:40:51,170 --> 00:40:55,796
Well, when she said it,
it just didn't sound as good as you.

560
00:40:55,796 --> 00:40:58,085
Oh, stop it.

561
00:40:58,085 --> 00:41:02,279
I heard from the young women on my crew
that this place was a hit.

562
00:41:02,279 --> 00:41:03,738
Now that I'm here,

563
00:41:03,738 --> 00:41:09,130
those girls don't usually have great taste,
but they know how to pick a bar.

564
00:41:12,090 --> 00:41:14,825
- Here is your Pilot's Halo.
- Thank you.

565
00:41:14,825 --> 00:41:16,596
I'll do it myself.

566
00:41:17,170 --> 00:41:18,995
Enjoy. Let me know if you need anything.

567
00:41:18,995 --> 00:41:20,635
Thanks.

568
00:41:22,439 --> 00:41:27,384
What's worth noticing is
how beautiful the owner is, right?

569
00:41:27,384 --> 00:41:29,704
I think she actually looks pretty good.

570
00:41:36,140 --> 00:41:38,465
This drink doesn't taste good either.

571
00:41:38,465 --> 00:41:40,450
Really?

572
00:41:40,450 --> 00:41:42,330
Let me try it.

573
00:41:45,440 --> 00:41:46,464
I think it's fine.

574
00:41:46,464 --> 00:41:50,104
Then drink your own.
You've got some. Why are you drinking mine?

575
00:41:53,823 --> 00:41:55,528
I have a question for you.

576
00:41:55,528 --> 00:41:59,045
So this is a flight-themed bar.

577
00:41:59,045 --> 00:42:01,611
And it's close to the airport.

578
00:42:01,611 --> 00:42:05,045
I think a lot of your coworkers
would come here, right?

579
00:42:05,045 --> 00:42:06,830
Hard to say.

580
00:42:06,830 --> 00:42:11,245
People in our line of work wouldn't like a bar
that smells like overtime.

581
00:42:11,245 --> 00:42:14,190
So what are we now?

582
00:42:14,190 --> 00:42:16,205
Working overtime?

583
00:42:16,205 --> 00:42:20,125
We're on a date.

584
00:42:30,925 --> 00:42:33,485
This cocktail really is average.

585
00:42:33,485 --> 00:42:37,485
The decor's not bad,
but the cocktail isn't to either of our tastes.

586
00:42:37,485 --> 00:42:39,325
And the band is way too loud.

587
00:42:39,325 --> 00:42:40,445
How about this?

588
00:42:40,445 --> 00:42:42,605
There's a lounge downstairs in my hotel.

589
00:42:42,605 --> 00:42:44,764
I have some bottles saved there.
How about we go there?

590
00:42:44,764 --> 00:42:46,685
But I wanted to see the show.

591
00:42:46,685 --> 00:42:48,405
Does your lounge have live music?

592
00:42:48,405 --> 00:42:50,405
If you want to hear singing,
I can sing for you.

593
00:42:50,405 --> 00:42:51,525
Then sing now.

594
00:42:51,525 --> 00:42:52,879
Now?

595
00:42:53,445 --> 00:42:55,125
You sure?

596
00:42:57,710 --> 00:43:00,765
What song should I sing?

597
00:43:00,765 --> 00:43:02,430
I'm kidding.

598
00:43:02,430 --> 00:43:03,965
I was messing with you.

599
00:43:03,965 --> 00:43:07,390
Actually, today,
I just wanted it to be the two of us.

600
00:43:07,390 --> 00:43:11,483
I wanted to find some quiet place
where we can have a real talk.

601
00:43:11,483 --> 00:43:12,923
For real.

602
00:43:15,085 --> 00:43:16,295
All right.

603
00:43:16,295 --> 00:43:18,365
I'm going to use the restroom.

604
00:43:18,365 --> 00:43:20,045
I will finish this drink, and we'll leave.

605
00:43:20,045 --> 00:43:21,830
Okay. No problem. Hurry up.

606
00:43:21,830 --> 00:43:23,710
Wait for me.

607
00:43:32,728 --> 00:43:34,888
Ruan Si Xian?

608
00:43:36,991 --> 00:43:38,831
Jiang?

